SEQUENCE:1
SUMMARY:READY TO BE SEEN N.1
LOCATION:BIASA Art Ubud
DESCRIPTION:The first in a planned series of nine exhibitions\, the READY T
 O BE SEEN N.1 showcase at BIASA Art Ubud brings together the works of Jasm
 ine Ansori and Josephine Kingsley\, two artists living and working in Bali
  whose practices explore memory\, perception\, materiality\, and the subtl
 e traces left by experience. Running from 1 September to 15 November 2026 
 \, the READY TO BE SEEN N.1 exhibition forms part of the ongoing commitmen
 t of BIASA Art to giving artists new to the public eye a platform to prese
 nt their work. It encourages visitors to engage with new practices at acce
 ssible price points\, creating an opportunity for those who connect with a
  work to take their first step into collecting or commissioning art. Born 
 in 1997 and educated in Fine Arts at the Bandung Institute of Technology (
 ITB)\, Jasmine Ansori is a multidisciplinary artist whose practice moves b
 etween fine art\, graphic design\, and digital media. Her work is driven b
 y research\, experimentation\, and an interest in imagery capable of trigg
 ering emotion and evoking a feeling of liminality.\n\nMore info: https://w
 ww.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/ready-to-be-seen-n-1/\n\nPlease verify wi
 th the organizer before attending.
URL:https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/ready-to-be-seen-n-1/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
END:VEVENT
